OL,3,GNEWSADecision to close care homes to go
OL,4,Aback to cabinet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority's decision to close
OL,7,Fcare homes is to go back to its cabinet
OL,8,Ffor further discussion.
OL,10,FEarlier this month, Reform UK-led West
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Council approved
OL,12,Fproposals affecting 250 people,
OL,13,Fincluding 81 who live in Southfields
OL,14,FHouse and Obelisk House care homes in
OL,15,FNorthampton.
OL,17,FBut at a meeting of the authority's
OL,18,Fadult social care, health and
OL,19,Fcommunities overview and scrutiny
OL,20,Fcommittee on Monday, members voted in
OL,21,Ffavour of the decision being looked at
OL,22,Fagain.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
